    <rigor>FULL</rigor>
    <rigor-reason>Edits the ADR-039 deterministic PreFilter / tool projection — the defining constraint of the whole project; requires code-review + adr-check.</rigor-reason>
    <model-tier>opus</model-tier>
    <model-tier-reason>The bounded allow-list MUST narrow the deterministic pre-filter and MUST NOT become a second decider / classifier — the highest ADR-039 sensitivity point in R4.</model-tier-reason>
    <effort>xhigh</effort>
    <parallel-group>Wave1-E1</parallel-group>
    <parallel-safe>false</parallel-safe>
    <parallel-reason>Edits AgentToolProjection / AgentToolCatalogProjector (shared BFF, ADR-039 boundary) — sequential Services/Ai spine with 010/012; coordinate assistant-r3; run /conflict-check before the PR.</parallel-reason>
